<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- NUMANA</book>
  <para style="toc1">2TH - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">2TH - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">2TH - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="mt1">2TH - NUMANA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Nga Bulus, Sila bǝn Timoti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TH 1:1">Ta cɛr shar anɛr abǝ zǝ Arik ne Tasalɔnika, ne sak kɛ Arik Tetɛɛ amɔr bǝn Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi:<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Ina didik bǝn sɔŋ kɛ sik bɛ yi ne atu amin ire bǝn Arik Tetɛɛ bǝn Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyɛr bǝn ben Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Akpa amɔr, Nǝ rɛ te kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ bɔbɔk tabǝ nyɛr Arik ne tu amin. Nǝ rɛ tǝ tabǝ na amɛ, tǝ tanyɛmɛ min iflu ngɔŋ bǝn nyɛr yiŋ ndi kɔtǝ ŋɔ nǝ miŋ min izǝn tǝ ngɔŋ. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Waŋa ai ki yiŋ ndi ta ŋur asa bǝne bɛzhin nɛ Akabaŋkɔŋ ayou Arik. Ta ŋur asa nǝ ir kǝŋ ndi izhin zǝn vuŋ kpa tǝna tanyɛmɛ nǝ sak iya bǝn iya yiŋ ndi izhin zǝn yigǝ.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Iki yiŋɛ bɔbɔk iyi didik bǝn Arik, ne yi amɛ atei tɔ zhin ashaga ayi ne kɔb Arik, keŋ ndi izhin ne yik iya ne atu amaa. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Arik ayi didik: Atei duŋ abaŋ ndi ne nǝk zhin iya abɛ yik iya <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />atai nǝk zhin sɔŋ sik ne tu abaŋ ndi ne nek zhin iya, bǝn taba mɔr yimɛ. Iyiŋɛ itei yi ne mkpaŋ keŋ ndi Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ atei rɛ gbar shu ne lilɛn lu bǝn abɛ shar amaa abaŋ ndi ayi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ, <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />nǝ lǝlɛn kǝ lu, tǝ abɛ sak abǝ kyak Arik iya bǝn abaŋ ndi akyak zǝ lɛ didik kǝ men nɛtu Ŋgɔŋ amɔr Yesɔ. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />A tei yik iya yi sak iya yaŋ klɛ tu, ne yar ba ne angus akɛ Ŋgɔŋ Arik bǝn mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ klik maa <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />ne mkpaŋ kɛ ŋur kam nyak nǝ ngɔŋ maa abɛ tsetser amaa atei nǝgu ŋgɔŋ tǝ bɛ yi ki vuŋ anu yi aneshir bɔbɔk ndi ne ta lɛ maa. Iyiŋɛ ne vuŋ, izhin aba abɛ tanyɛmɛ ne lɛ maa.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Nǝ nkan kiki yiŋɛ, ta zen ben zhin Arik, te Arik amɔr abɛ duŋ zhin bɛ mla abɛ zhɔ, abɛ nǝk zhin ki didik yiŋ ndi zhin wɔ bǝ ne asusun amin, abɛ na nǝk zhin idǝk min kɛ nǝk atu amin ne mgbyamgbyaŋ maa. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Ta ben te sak kɛ Ŋgɔŋ amɔr Yesɔ bǝ yi ngɔŋ ne atu amin, izhin ne min maa, ire ki didik yi Arik amɔr bǝn Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Iner ne fa nzak waŋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Ne tu ayi kam nyak yi ngɔŋ amɔr Yesɔ Kristi bǝn biŋ sɔŋ mɔr tǝ tabǝ yi bǝnebɔu: Mǝ mben zhin akpa amuŋ, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />kǝr zhin bǝ duŋ cok nǝ lǝle yi tɔ min ba ka abǝ di tǝ Ibɛr yi Ŋgɔŋ nǝka nyɛ. Aka yik tedi ta bla mɛ nǝ zǝn bla tɔ ti, kɔ nǝ du lɛ maa, kɔ ta bǝ cɛr kǝ nǝ mple. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Kǝr zhin bǝ duŋ nuŋ alɔm zhin nǝ kɔte ankɔŋ anuŋ ba, te bɛr yiŋɛ ba tei nyɛ ba se inǝ fa nzaga atei gli ner nǝ fa nzaga agli arumɔ, ndi ne nau anyak nǝ gar lu. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Atei kyak kɔnǝ zhɔ tǝ arik kai iki yi yaŋ vlǝ ndi a zɔ kurǝ tǝ bena zhɔk tumaa nɛ atu men bɔbɔk. Atei na yir miŋ ate zɛsɔŋ nɛ akabaŋkɔŋ ayou Arik tɛ di wa abe yi Arik.<verse eid="2TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Ba zhin ne shu zhi ndi mne yi bǝn abɛ zhin mne bǝn bla zhin kiki yiŋɛ kai? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Fe azizaŋa izhin nǝ zhi iki yiŋ ndi vuŋu nyak, te duŋu abɛ gliu arumɔ ne mkpaŋ maa. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Fena iklik yi yaŋ zhi iyi fa nzak izǝn na ndum; ankyak waŋ ndi ne vuŋu atse nyaga atei zǝn na mɛ raraŋ mla ne mkpaŋ kɛ baŋu gli tibɛ. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Ankyak inǝ fa nzaga atei gliu arumɔ, iwaŋ ndi Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ a tei turu atyak azhɔk ne ŋguŋgu kɛ vli kɛ anu amaa te ŋunu ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ nyɛ maa. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Ine fa nzaga atai nyɛ nǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ ndum shetan te zǝn na kiki yi vuŋ anu bǝn ten bǝn ti mu, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />bǝn kuŋkɔŋ mimin te zǝn kpur abaŋ ndi azǝn dɔ. Atei dɔ tǝ na kyak ta tǝna nyɛr zub tǝ be ka li aru. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />nǝ yiŋɛ Arik ne shar ba ne ki ŋgɔŋgɔŋ iyi lɔm ba te duŋ ba abɛ tanyɛmɛ nǝ mu. <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />Tǝ iklɛ tumɔ iyi tǝ bɔbɔk abaŋ ndi bane tanyɛmɛ nǝ zub, ama tɛ kama wɔ men kǝ ki mimin, atei tǝ ba ambuk.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nɛ hria zhin nǝ ta zhɔk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Ta tei nyɛr Arik iyaŋ mkpaŋ ne atu min, akpa, izhinɛbaŋ ndi Ŋgɔŋ anyɛr zhin. Tǝ Arik nɛ hria zhin ndi abǝ kuti nǝ ta zhɔk nǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ kǝ Izhu tsetser tǝ be duŋ zhin yi anɛr tsetser bǝn tanyɛmɛ nǝ zub. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Arik ne zhɔ zhin ne lɛ didik kǝ men ta du zhin nekǝ; nɛ zhɔzhin tǝ izhin bǝ yi nǝ ntǝk ngɔŋ min kǝ Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi amɔr. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Ne me, akpa amɔr, izhin bǝ klɛ mgbamgbaŋ te na gli tsar yiŋ ndi ta ne tsar zhin neyi, kɔ ba te cɛr zhin ane yi ba.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Mben te Ŋgɔŋ amɔr Yesɔ Kristi ne tu maa bǝn Arik Tetɛɛ amɔr, waŋ ndi a nyɛr ta bǝn ita zhɔk maa nɛ duŋ ta yi mgbamgbaŋ iyaŋ klɛ bǝn zhɔk susun didik, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />nǝk zhin akpa asusun amin bǝn klik min ne kɔte ki didik ta yi bǝn lɛ didik.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Iwɔb yi ben Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Ne klɛ tu, akpa amɔr, ben zhinta Arik tǝ lɛ kǝ Ŋgɔŋ bǝ zǝn flu ngɔŋ tǝ abɛna ta kǝ nǝ ngɔŋ, ndi nǝ yi amɛ nǝ miŋ min. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Te na ben Arik te bɛ agli ta rumɔ ne ŋɔk aner mimin, te ba kɔte ŋɔ ne tanyɛmɛ ne susun maa ba. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Ama Ŋgɔŋ ana didik, fe atei na duŋ ta klik tǝna ku zhin nǝ tu ner mimin. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Ta ne tanyɛmɛ bɛn Ŋgɔŋ waŋ ndi izhin zǝ lɛ maa kǝŋ ndi ta ne bla zhin. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Ta ben te Arik abɛ gli asusun amin agar bǝn tanyɛmɛ ye Arik bǝn vuŋ susun iyi Kristi.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gbaŋ atɔŋ ne sɔŋ kǝ sha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Amɛ amunzumɔr, ta nek zhin anu ne sak kɛ Arik bǝn Yesɔ Kristi, izhin bɛ gli a tu min te shan bǝn aner abaŋ ndi ate ankɔ abaŋ ndi ba tanyɛmɛ ne lɛ kǝŋ ndi tane tsar zhin ne kɛ ba. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Izhin ba ne tu min izhin ne zhi ki yiŋ ndi izhin tei zi iki na mɔr. Bata ne sɔŋ sha ba ndi ta ni yi ben abɛ zhin, <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />ba ta ne na li kili ye ŋun sha yaŋ ya ba. ne me, tane na ndum aririk bǝn bu, tane na ndum te lɔn te kǝr tabǝ duŋ abɛ yik iya ne tu amɔr ba. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Ta nǝ na amɛ, kǝr zhin bǝ yik tǝ di ba ta ne mla tǝ abɛ lɔk tama ne ikiki yiŋɛ ba; ama ta nǝ na amɛ te ta bǝ yii zhin iki zǝ. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Neme ndi ta ne yi ben abɛ zhin, ta ne nǝk zhin lɛ kǝŋ: &lt;&lt;Waŋ ndi ba te na ndum ba kǝr bǝ nǝgu la ta li ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Ta ne wɔ te di anuŋ ne miŋ min akɔ sɔŋ sha. Ba na ndum ba; anak zhik gɔŋ bǝn anuŋ. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Ir aneshir abaŋa ta bla ba te na vǝ ba ne sak kɛ Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ kristi te bɛ zedɔ te na ndum te wɔb la kɛ li men. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Ama izhineba, akpa, izhin bǝ dǝk ne na iki didik ba.<verse eid="2TH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Iwaŋ ndi ba te zi ilɛ kɛ bla mɔr keŋ ben icɛr mɔr iyiŋ ba, izhin bǝ su ayi bǝn abɛba. kǝr izhin bǝ yaŋ akpa bǝn abɛba ba, ne na me shisha tei te ba. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Amɛ kǝr izhin bǝ baŋ ba abɛ tǝ zɔr amin ba, ama izhin bǝ vǝ ba ndi abǝ zǝ Kristi.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itek yi Bulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Neme Ŋgɔŋ ne nǝk sik susun bɛ nek izhin sik susun ne kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ ne kɔte ankɔŋ atawa. Arik abɛ yi bǝn abɛ zhin bɔbɔk min. <verse eid="2TH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Nǝ ŋɔk muŋ mǝne cɛr itǝk yiŋɛ: Itǝk yi rɛ bǝn Bulus. waŋa ayi irkǝŋ ndi M sak ŋɔk nǝ kote cɛr tayi. <verse eid="2TH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Ita zhɔk yi Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi bǝ yi bǝn abɛ zhin bɔbɔk.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>